Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET product ID: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/product/7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET product review: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/product/5/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET product id not integer: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/product/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET endpoint not found: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/product/1/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST product: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/product
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Pocari",
    "category": "MINUMAN",
    "price": 15000.00,
    "stock": 33
}

